     "2": "<b>F</b>. The outline has been drawn; somebody must now paint it. 'Volunteers... turned up with brushes' does that, and 'By Sunday evening even the sceptics had stopped to watch' continues the story of that weekend.",
     "3": "<b>A</b>. 'visitors were arriving by coach' leads to Olga's worry that one picture would not keep them coming. The next sentence, 'She therefore organised an advertising campaign', is her solution; 'She' = Olga.",
