     "2": "The paragraph needs something that explains why the air show mattered. 'One aircraft' and 'a silent glider' lead into 'I wanted to go up there immediately'.",
     "3": "'Less glamorous than she had imagined' is explained by the list of dull jobs. The next sentence ('Gliders are heavy to move') gives the reason for the pushing.",
